---
import Section from '../components/ui/section.astro'
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro'
import Heading from '../components/ui/heading.astro'
import Button from '../components/ui/button.astro'
import {
  ArrowRight,
  BarChart3,
  Briefcase,
  Check,
  Code,
  Database,
  Lightbulb,
  MessageCircle,
  TrendingUp,
  Users,
  Zap,
} from '@lucide/astro'
import List from '../components/ui/list.astro'
import Card from '../components/ui/card.astro'
import Pill from '../components/ui/pill.astro'
---

<MainLayout
  seo={{
    title: 'Technical Consulting | Human Side of Code',
    description:
      'Expert technical leadership for growing companies. Strategic advisory, team transformation, and unlocking the hidden value in your existing technology.',
  }}
  schema={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'ProfessionalService',
    'name': 'HuSOC Technical Consulting',
    'description':
      'Expert technical leadership for growing companies. Strategic advisory, team transformation, and unlocking the hidden value in your existing technology.',
    'provider': {
      '@type': 'Organization',
      'name': 'Human Side of Code',
      'url': 'https://www.humansideofcode.com',
    },
  }}
>
  <Section
    classList='flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[50vh] text-center space-y-8'
  >
    <Pill
      theme='accent'
      classList='mb-4'
      >Technical Consulting</Pill
    >
    <Heading
      level={1}
      text='Technical Leadership for Growing Companies'
      highlight='Growing'
      classList='max-w-[70ch]'
    />
    <p class='text-xl max-w-[70ch]'>
      Most businesses aren't tech companies - but they all use technology. The
      question is: are you getting the value you could be?
    </p>
    <p class='text-lg max-w-[70ch]'>
      I help scale-ups and SMEs unlock their technical potential, build
      high-performing engineering teams, and turn technology from a cost centre
      into a competitive advantage.
    </p>
    <div class='flex gap-4 items-center flex-wrap justify-center'>
      <Button
        href='#services'
        theme='primary'
        type='solid'
        >Explore Services <ArrowRight class='ml-auto' /></Button
      >
      <Button
        href='#contact'
        theme='secondary'
        type='outline'
        >Let's Discuss Your Needs</Button
      >
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section
    theme='secondary'
    classList='space-y-12'
  >
    <div class='text-center space-y-6'>
      <Heading
        level={2}
        text='The Problem'
        highlight='Problem'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='text-lg max-w-[70ch] mx-auto space-y-4'>
      <p>
        You're not a tech company. You're in logistics, utilities, local
        government, automotive, hospitality, or any number of industries where
        technology is critical but not your core business.
      </p>
      <p>And somewhere along the way, things aren't quite right:</p>
      <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-8'>
        <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg'>
          <p class='font-semibold'>
            Your development team isn't delivering the value you expected
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg'>
          <p class='font-semibold'>
            You're paying for technology but can't see the ROI
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg'>
          <p class='font-semibold'>
            You suspect there's untapped potential in your existing systems
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg'>
          <p class='font-semibold'>
            Your technical team and business stakeholders don't speak the same
            language
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>
        Here's the thing: <strong
          >tech-first companies already know how to handle this.</strong
        > But if you're a traditional business that happens to use technology? You
        need someone who understands both worlds.
      </p>
      <p class='text-xl font-semibold'>That's where I come in.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section classList='space-y-12'>
    <div class='text-center space-y-6'>
      <Heading
        level={2}
        text='What Makes This Different'
        highlight='Different'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4'>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title="I've Done It At Scale"
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: TrendingUp }}
      >
        <p>
          Nearly 15 years leading technical teams for companies from startups to
          £4.7B enterprises. I've been the sole technologist during rapid
          scale-up and Head of Development for multi-billion pound operations.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title='I Speak Both Languages'
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: MessageCircle }}
      >
        <p>
          I translate between developers and boardrooms. I can explain technical
          concepts to non-technical stakeholders and business needs to
          engineering teams. That's my superpower.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title="It's Not Just About Code"
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: Users }}
      >
        <p>
          Most technical problems are actually people problems. I fix team
          dynamics, communication breakdowns, and cultural issues that hold
          technical delivery back.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title='I Find Hidden Value'
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: Lightbulb }}
      >
        <p>
          You're probably sitting on data and systems that could drive real
          business value. I've built reporting suites, customer analytics
          platforms, and strategic models from "data we already had."
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section
    theme='secondary'
    classList='space-y-12'
  >
    <div class='text-center space-y-6'>
      <a id='services'></a>
      <Heading
        level={2}
        text='How I Can Help'
        highlight='Help'
      />
      <p class='text-xl max-w-[70ch] mx-auto'>
        Three core services, tailored to what you actually need.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4'>
      <Card
        title='Strategic Advisory'
        icon={{
          icon: Lightbulb,
        }}
        theme='primary'
      >
        <Pill
          slot='pill-slot'
          theme='primary'
          >Most Popular</Pill
        >
        <p>
          Assess your current technical capability, identify quick wins and
          strategic opportunities, provide actionable recommendations.
        </p>
        <List
          theme='primary'
          items={[
            { icon: Check, text: 'Technical capability assessment' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Architecture & system design review' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Technology strategy & roadmapping' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Technical due diligence' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Vendor & tool evaluation' },
          ]}
        />
        <p class='text-sm mt-4'>
          <strong>Typical engagement:</strong> 4-6 weeks for full assessment and
          recommendations
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        title='Team Transformation'
        icon={{
          icon: Users,
        }}
        theme='primary'
      >
        <p>
          Work directly with your development team to improve performance,
          velocity, and morale. Fix the people problems holding your tech back.
        </p>
        <List
          theme='primary'
          items={[
            { icon: Check, text: 'Team process optimization' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Engineering culture building' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Performance issue diagnosis' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Communication & collaboration coaching' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Developer mentoring & growth plans' },
          ]}
        />
        <p class='text-sm mt-4'>
          <strong>Typical engagement:</strong> 3-6 months for sustainable cultural
          change
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        title='Hands-On Projects'
        icon={{
          icon: Code,
        }}
        theme='primary'
      >
        <p>
          Defined-scope technical projects to unlock immediate value. Build what
          you need, set up your team for success, then hand it over.
        </p>
        <List
          theme='primary'
          items={[
            { icon: Check, text: 'Data & analytics infrastructure' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Reporting & business intelligence' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Technical process implementation' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'Code & architecture review' },
            { icon: Check, text: 'CI/CD & DevOps setup' },
          ]}
        />
        <p class='text-sm mt-4'>
          <strong>Typical engagement:</strong> 6-12 weeks depending on scope
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
    <div class='text-center'>
      <p class='text-lg mb-4'>
        Plus: <strong>Fractional Technical Leadership</strong> available for companies
        needing ongoing strategic input without a full-time hire.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section classList='space-y-12'>
    <div class='text-center space-y-6'>
      <Heading
        level={2}
        text='Who Is This For?'
        highlight='Who'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4'>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title='Scale-Ups & SMEs'
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: TrendingUp }}
      >
        <p>
          Growing quickly but your tech isn't keeping up. Need technical
          leadership without the full-time hire commitment.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title='Non-Tech Businesses'
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: Briefcase }}
      >
        <p>
          You're in logistics, utilities, government, automotive, hospitality -
          tech supports your business but isn't your core competency.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title='Underperforming Dev Teams'
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: Users }}
      >
        <p>
          You've got developers but they're not delivering. The team is
          frustrated, velocity is low, and you're not sure why.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card
        inline={true}
        title='Hidden Tech Potential'
        theme='primary'
        icon={{ icon: Database }}
      >
        <p>
          You know you're sitting on valuable data and systems but don't know
          how to leverage them for business advantage.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section
    theme='secondary'
    classList='space-y-12'
  >
    <div class='text-center space-y-6'>
      <Heading
        level={2}
        text='Real Results'
        highlight='Results'
      />
      <p class='text-xl max-w-[70ch] mx-auto'>
        Examples of value delivered for growing companies.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class='max-w-[70ch] mx-auto space-y-8'>
      <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg space-y-4'>
        <div class='flex items-start gap-3'>
          <BarChart3 class='w-8 h-8 text-accent flex-shrink-0' />
          <div>
            <h3 class='font-semibold text-xl'>
              Built Entire Analytics Infrastructure From Scratch
            </h3>
            <p class='text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2'>
              Multi-site hospitality business during scale-up
            </p>
            <p>
              Company had on-premises databases but no reporting capability.
              Built comprehensive Customer Data Platform, LTV calculation
              models, and property suitability models that directly informed
              £8M+ expansion decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg space-y-4'>
        <div class='flex items-start gap-3'>
          <TrendingUp class='w-8 h-8 text-accent flex-shrink-0' />
          <div>
            <h3 class='font-semibold text-xl'>
              Turned Around Underperforming Team
            </h3>
            <p class='text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2'>
              £4.7B enterprise with 8,500+ employees
            </p>
            <p>
              Development team wasn't delivering value on critical
              re-platforming project. Implemented direct feedback, structured
              development plans, and "manager as coach" approach. Team velocity
              increased significantly and successfully delivered enterprise
              architecture redesign.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg space-y-4'>
        <div class='flex items-start gap-3'>
          <Zap class='w-8 h-8 text-accent flex-shrink-0' />
          <div>
            <h3 class='font-semibold text-xl'>
              Secured £242,000 in Cost Savings
            </h3>
            <p class='text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2'>Vendor negotiations</p>
            <p>
              Through strategic vendor negotiations while simultaneously
              architecting complete overhaul of website search functionality.
              Improved performance from 30 to 70 (Page Speed Insights) resulting
              in increased organic traffic.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='bg-white p-6 rounded-lg space-y-4'>
        <div class='flex items-start gap-3'>
          <Database class='w-8 h-8 text-accent flex-shrink-0' />
          <div>
            <h3 class='font-semibold text-xl'>
              Modernised Legacy Infrastructure
            </h3>
            <p class='text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2'>
              Multi-site operations company
            </p>
            <p>
              Led complete infrastructure modernisation, migrating legacy
              on-premises servers and databases to cloud architecture.
              Implemented cloud-based business intelligence using PowerBI that
              fundamentally transformed how leadership measured performance and
              made decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section classList='space-y-12'>
    <div class='text-center space-y-6'>
      <Heading
        level={2}
        text='How It Works'
        highlight='Works'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='max-w-[70ch] mx-auto space-y-6'>
      <div class='flex gap-4 items-start'>
        <div
          class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-bold'
        >
          1
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class='font-semibold text-lg mb-2'>
            Initial Discussion (No Pressure, Free)
          </h3>
          <p>
            We'll talk about your challenges, what you've tried, and what you're
            hoping to achieve. I'll be honest about whether I can help and what
            that might look like.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='flex gap-4 items-start'>
        <div
          class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-bold'
        >
          2
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class='font-semibold text-lg mb-2'>Scoping & Proposal</h3>
          <p>
            Based on our discussion, I'll propose an engagement structure -
            whether that's strategic advisory, team transformation, a hands-on
            project, or a combination. Clear scope, clear timeline, clear
            outcomes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='flex gap-4 items-start'>
        <div
          class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-bold'
        >
          3
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class='font-semibold text-lg mb-2'>Engagement</h3>
          <p>
            I work with you and your team to deliver the agreed outcomes.
            Regular communication, no surprises, and a focus on sustainable
            results rather than quick fixes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='flex gap-4 items-start'>
        <div
          class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-bold'
        >
          4
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class='font-semibold text-lg mb-2'>Handover & Support</h3>
          <p>
            For defined projects, I hand over with full documentation and
            knowledge transfer. For ongoing relationships, we agree what
            continued support looks like - whether that's periodic check-ins or
            fractional leadership.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
  <Section classList='space-y-12'>
    <div class='text-center space-y-6'>
      <Heading
        level={2}
        text='Frequently Asked Questions'
        highlight='Questions'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='max-w-[70ch] mx-auto space-y-8'>
      <div class='space-y-2'>
        <h3 class='text-xl font-semibold'>What's your pricing model?</h3>
        <p class='text-lg'>
          I work on day rates for most engagements, with options for retainers
          for ongoing relationships or project-based pricing for defined scopes.
          Pricing depends on the nature and complexity of the work - we'll
          discuss this in our initial conversation.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='space-y-2'>
        <h3 class='text-xl font-semibold'>Do you work on-site or remotely?</h3>
        <p class='text-lg'>
          Primarily remote with occasional on-site visits as needed. I'm based
          in Newcastle but work with companies across the UK.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='space-y-2'>
        <h3 class='text-xl font-semibold'>How quickly can you start?</h3>
        <p class='text-lg'>
          It depends on my current commitments and the scope of your project.
          Typically, I can begin initial discovery within 1-2 weeks, with full
          engagement starting shortly after.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='space-y-2'>
        <h3 class='text-xl font-semibold'>Do you write code yourself?</h3>
        <p class='text-lg'>
          Yes, but that's not the primary value I bring. I can do hands-on
          technical work for defined projects, but I'm not available for ongoing
          code-for-hire or staff augmentation. My strength is strategic
          leadership, architecture, and team transformation.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='space-y-2'>
        <h3 class='text-xl font-semibold'>
          What if we're not sure what we need?
        </h3>
        <p class='text-lg'>
          That's exactly what the initial discussion is for. Many companies know
          something isn't working but aren't sure what the root cause is. That's
          where assessment and advisory work comes in - we diagnose first, then
          propose solutions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='space-y-2'>
        <h3 class='text-xl font-semibold'>Can you provide references?</h3>
        <p class='text-lg'>
          Yes, I can connect you with previous clients who can speak to the
          results delivered. I'll provide these during our discussion if we both
          feel there's a good fit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section theme='accent'>
    <a id='contact'></a>
    <div
      class='w-full bg-primary rounded-xl text-white flex flex-col items-center gap-6 p-12 overflow-hidden relative'
    >
      <div
        class='rounded-full w-64 h-64 -right-32 -top-32 bg-accent/20 absolute'
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class='rounded-full w-64 h-64 -left-32 -bottom-32 bg-accent/20 absolute'
      >
      </div>
      <Heading
        classList='z-[1]'
        level={2}
        text="Let's Discuss Your Needs"
      />
      <p class='text-lg z-[1] text-center max-w-[70ch]'>
        Not every project is a good fit, and that's okay. Let's have a
        conversation about your challenges and see if working together makes
        sense.
      </p>
      <p class='z-[1] text-center'>
        No pressure. No sales pitch. Just an honest discussion about how I might
        be able to help.
      </p>
      <div class='flex gap-6 mt-6 z-[1] flex-wrap justify-center'>
        <Button
          href='/contact'
          theme='secondary'
          type='solid'
        >
          <MessageCircle />Get In Touch<ArrowRight />
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section classList='text-center'>
    <p class='text-lg italic max-w-[70ch] mx-auto'>
      Most technical problems are actually people problems. Let's fix both.
    </p>
  </Section>
</MainLayout>
